{'symbol': 'ROK', 'date': '2022-08-11 07:00:00', 'title': 'ROCKWELL AUTOMATION OPENS REGISTRATION TO THE 31ST ANNUAL AUTOMATION FAIR®, RETURNS TO CHICAGO', 'text': "MILWAUKEE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ROCKWELL AUTOMATION, INC. (NYSE: ROK), THE WORLD'S LARGEST COMPANY DEDICATED TO INDUSTRIAL AUTOMATION AND DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION, IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT REGISTRATION IS NOW OPEN FOR AUTOMATION FAIR 2022, HOSTED BY ROCKWELL AND MEMBERS OF ITS GLOBAL PARTNERNETWORK™ PROGRAM. THE ANNUAL EVENT WILL BE HELD AT MCCORMICK PLACE WEST IN CHICAGO, ILLINOIS, NOV. 14-17, AND EXPECTS TO BRING OVER 10,000 MANUFACTURING AND TECHNOLOGY LEADERS FROM AROUND THE GLOBE TO EXPERIENC"}